'''Winter General Kaihime''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]]. She is an [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] variant of [[Narita Kaihime (Uber Rare Cat)|Narita Kaihime]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 777
|rarity = UR
