==Trivia==
*The title 冬将軍 ''Fuyu Shōgun'' in Winter General Kaihime's Japanese name is a direct translation of [[wikipedia:Russian Winter|General Winter]], a personification of a harsh winter used especially in military contexts, namely invasions of Russia failing because of the harsh climate. In Japan, it most commonly refers to the [[wikipedia:Siberian High|Siberian High]].

